06)"; new §8 row *Country chooser*; BR-07 points to §8.1. Q-14 and Q-28 cells untouched. **(4) US-01-R1-F02 (context of F01), AC-28 widened, ID kept:** glossary entry *Anonymous request* (any request Strapi does not authenticate: no header, non-Bearer scheme, empty or invalid `Bearer`, any letter case of `/api`, Strapi's port or the proxy); BR-06 references it; AC-28's draft outline now has 14 rows (7 variants × 2 entry points) and a `publishedAt` check, a new outline for draft countries (5 rows), and a note that error responses satisfy the `Then` and that the other publication parameters are covered by the same rows; write scenario unchanged; §11 e2e table and AC-28 row updated (still 4 e2e files). **(5) ADRs:** ADR-0006 (amends ADR-0001's physical model) referenced in the metadata and in §7 and §10 as in progress. Also: new glossary entry *Wire shape / logical shape*; sources list adds Review R1. No ID renumbered or retired; no ID added. Unchanged: §1, §2, BR-01..BR-05, BR-08, AC-01..AC-13, AC-15..AC-27, §6 (all rows and *Human answer* cells), §7.2, §7.3, §9, §12. Counts: 8 BR, 28 AC (4 original, 24 derived), 28 Q (none blocks HC1). |
